    "detailed_description": "<h1>Unity's Creator Spotlight</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Unity\u2019s Creator Spotlight on YouTube on Thursday, January 30th, at 6 PM CET!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cat Detective Albert Wilde will be discussed by Maria, Andreas, and Jackson as we dive into the technical and creative elements of the game.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.poster.avif?t=1746099342\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.webm?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.mp4?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</strong> is a 1930s noir-inspired detective game with humanoid animal characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How does Albert Wilde solve the strangest quantum mystery in a murder case? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out in this 6-7 hours silly and hilarious classic detective adventure tribute to the golden age of noir movies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/dea827a3e7c40a29ef0967b12ea797e9.webp?t=1746099342\" /></div>Use your years of experience of interrogating and drinking at bars to chat with locals to solve a mystery. Rely on your cat-charisma to find the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/9287497e11fba62815f9022be897e273.webp?t=1746099342\" /></div>Meet a cast of 27 interesting characters like a pole-dancing flamingo, a piggy lawyer, a pissed-off moose bookie, an out-of-tune sheep singer, a FAMOUS SCIENTIST and the dangerous crocodile gang. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/64efed43512bc1ab0eb45738d9859a1b.webp?t=1746099342\" /></div>Albert Wilde is down on his luck. He\u2019s broke, he\u2019s friendless, he can\u2019t get a girl, and his landlord won\u2019t let him pee on the office wall anymore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.poster.avif?t=1746099342\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.webm?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.mp4?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Q &amp; A</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Is the game a combination of different genres?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, it\u2019s hard to define <i>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</i> by a single genre, as we tend to blend multiple elements in our projects. This game is a fusion of comedy, film noir, detective mystery, science fiction, and narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you describe the genre from a technical perspective?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From a technical perspective, you could describe it as something between a walking simulator and an interactive novel, with a strong emphasis on comedy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Is this game a kind of \u2018whodunnit\u2019 murder mystery game?\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s less of a typical &quot;whodunnit&quot; and more of an origin story\u2014showing how Albert Wilde evolves from a Private Investigator (P.I.) to a Quantum Private Investigator.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.poster.avif?t=1746099342\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.webm?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/c286f221aa3ba53dfdd351bdcacad79b.mp4?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</strong> is a 1930s noir-inspired detective game with humanoid animal characters. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">How does Albert Wilde solve the strangest quantum mystery in a murder case? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find out in this 6-7 hours silly and hilarious classic detective adventure tribute to the golden age of noir movies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/dea827a3e7c40a29ef0967b12ea797e9.webp?t=1746099342\" /></div>Use your years of experience of interrogating and drinking at bars to chat with locals to solve a mystery. Rely on your cat-charisma to find the truth.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/9287497e11fba62815f9022be897e273.webp?t=1746099342\" /></div>Meet a cast of 27 interesting characters like a pole-dancing flamingo, a piggy lawyer, a pissed-off moose bookie, an out-of-tune sheep singer, a FAMOUS SCIENTIST and the dangerous crocodile gang. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/64efed43512bc1ab0eb45738d9859a1b.webp?t=1746099342\" /></div>Albert Wilde is down on his luck. He\u2019s broke, he\u2019s friendless, he can\u2019t get a girl, and his landlord won\u2019t let him pee on the office wall anymore.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.poster.avif?t=1746099342\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.webm?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1810670/extras/65e24d442b7984448b1a5d45959d9ce5.mp4?t=1746099342\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Q &amp; A</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Is the game a combination of different genres?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Yes, it\u2019s hard to define <i>Cat Detective Albert Wilde</i> by a single genre, as we tend to blend multiple elements in our projects. This game is a fusion of comedy, film noir, detective mystery, science fiction, and narrative.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Can you describe the genre from a technical perspective?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From a technical perspective, you could describe it as something between a walking simulator and an interactive novel, with a strong emphasis on comedy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Is this game a kind of \u2018whodunnit\u2019 murder mystery game?\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s less of a typical &quot;whodunnit&quot; and more of an origin story\u2014showing how Albert Wilde evolves from a Private Investigator (P.I.) to a Quantum Private Investigator.</p>",
    "short_description": "Play as the Cat Detective Albert Wilde. Walk, talk, interrogate, joke, solve a mystery, and experience an old film noir setting with humanoid animal characters. A story of quantum theory and parallel universes served with a lot of humour.",
